# A copy of Restoration Magic (CR 707.10) is the same spell with the same mode: Leyline of Resonance copies Bot1's Cura (it
# targets only a single creature Bot1 controls). The copy keeps the mode (no modes question is asked, the ruling of
# 2025-06-06: "You cannot choose a new mode") and pays nothing: the two Plains tapped for Cura are the only mana spent and
# nothing is owed for the copy. Both resolve: Mother of Runes gains hexproof and indestructible and Bot1 gains 3 life for
# each, 6 in all (a Cura copy gains life, so the mode is Cura and not Cure).

